ickness, and other mysterious incidents at the old building. When Yui Furukawa, a quiet girl who transfered late into the school, appears before Sou, the gears of fate slowly begin to move.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Astronomy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":33,"spoiler":true},{"name":"CGI","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"In Search of the Lost Future","english":"In Search of the Lost Future","native":"失われた未来を求めて","romaji":"Ushinawareta Mirai wo Motomete","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"寻找失去的未来"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Ushinawareta Mirai o Motomete"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"われめて"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"追寻遗失的未来"}]},"trailer":{"id":"mghBYKjGngQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mghBYKjGngQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}